            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LINDSAY4"
            },
            "reviewBody": "On the positive side, these bars had great flavor, and the icing was terrific, but I wasn't impressed overall. The texture of the bars was way too mushy,it reminded me of baby food. The icing needs also to be cut in half.",
            "datePublished": "2004-02-16T21:50:02.043Z"
          },
